Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

OpenHup depends on third-party software at runtime. These are not redistributed
in this repository; they are fetched at install time by the package managers and
by scripts/fetch_models.py.

Machine-learning model weights are NOT included in this repository. Each entry in
models/registry.yaml records the model's upstream source, sha256 checksum, and
license. Operators are responsible for complying with the license of any model
they choose to download.

Notable licensing considerations:

  * Default detection models (YOLOX, RT-DETR / D-FINE) are Apache-2.0.
  * CLIP (OpenAI) reference weights are MIT-licensed.
  * Ultralytics YOLOv8 / YOLOv11 is AGPL-3.0. It is supported only as an opt-in
    backend and is neither a default nor vendored. Enabling it may impose AGPL
    obligations on your deployment; OpenHup's own Apache-2.0 license does not
    extend to it.
  * Optional integrations (Apprise, PyAV/FFmpeg, GStreamer, OpenCV) carry their
    own licenses (BSD-2, LGPL/GPL variants, Apache-2.0). Review these if you
    redistribute a built image.
